node_modules/
**/node_modules/
.turbo/
*.tsbuildinfo

### === packages/ts-client (generated — see note) === ###
# ts-client IS committed intentionally (blueprint §16.9 / §22.4 —
# CI fails on an uncommitted diff to catch breaking API changes).
# Do NOT add packages/ts-client/ here.

